  "bodyHash": "nVSyAB5zRFE=",
  "content": "<p>嗨，各位，<br><br>FancyCraft 變得，嗯，更 fancy 了！沒錯，就是這樣。有幾個原始材質已經困擾我很久了，比如門，它們一點都不 fancy。但現在不再是這樣了。我開始重新製作一些不夠標準的原始材質，把 fancy 程度調高到 11！快來看看新的門，還有新的鵝卵石和石磚吧。希望大家會喜歡。未來還會有更多更新，敬請期待！<br><br>JJJas0n 在 Minecraft 還很早期的時候就開始製作這個精彩的材質包。FancyCraft 一直以來都是最好的 HD 材質包之一。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.dropbox.com%252fs%252fhdfdgw9bll3qb5j%252fScreenshot%2b2014-05-06%2b06.22.27.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">我已經向 JJJason 請求並獲得許可，重新啟動這個品牌。</a><br><br>其他人也曾努力想延續這個材質包，但最後都放棄了。我從 JJJas0n 的最後一個版本重新開始。我努力維持 FancyCraft 最初設立的超高標準。請告訴我是否成功，以及我在哪些地方還需要改進。<br><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/869/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br>截圖感謝 <a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/project/kabs-resource-pack-showcase/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kab's Resource Pack Showcase</a>！<br><br>原始材質包的製作人員名單：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>字型來自 Misa's texturepack</li>\n<li>水、岩漿和環境材質來自 Scuttle's Texture pack。他慷慨地讓我使用這些材質；它們看起來很棒。</li>\n<li>這個材質包的靈感來自 Misa's 和 Scuttle's 的材質包。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/13/695/front.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"612\" height=\"337\"><br><br>授權 / 許可 (法律上的繁文縟節)：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若要將此材質包的內容重複用於其他材質包，請先取得許可。</li>\n<li>若要重新發布此內容，請先取得許可。</li>\n<li>若要撰寫附有螢幕截圖的評論，請註明出處並附上此討論串的連結。</li>\n<li>若要使用此內容製作影片，請註明出處並附上此討論串的連結。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/9/531/6440225889_c66d97a9f1_b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"961\"><br><br>請告訴我你喜歡哪些部分，尤其是你「不喜歡」哪些部分。對於那些不對勁的地方，如果你能告訴我為什麼不對勁，那麼我很有可能會修正它，至少會盡力而為。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/870/2016-02-29_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/871/2016-02-29_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/872/2016-02-29_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/873/2016-02-29_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/874/2016-02-29_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/875/2016-02-29_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><br>這些都是我製作的材質包，我相信裡面一定有您喜歡的：<br><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/76115-axels-forgotten-lands-resource-p\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Axel's Forgotten Lands Realistic Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/fortune-glory-jungle-ruins-textu/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Fortune &amp; Glory Jungle Ruins Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kab-pack-adventure/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 KabPack Adventure Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/236085-lord-trilobites-norsecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Lord Trilobite's Viking Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/darklands-medieval/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Darklands Medieval Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/even-time-x32-resource-pack/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 evenTime Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/223572-curse-cobalt-web-forms-textfield\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Athos Roman Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ad-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 TheVoid's AD-Reforged RPG Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/soulscribes-rezcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">x64 Soulscribe's RezCraft Tron Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/221074-mrshortees-bladecraft-cyberpunk-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x64 MrShortee's Bladecraft Cyberpunk Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><strong>Xaiwaker:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/222577-xaiwaker-x16-swirly-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Swirly Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/222516-xaiwaker-x32-swirly-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Swirly Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><strong>The Doctor:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/the-doctor-x16-whovian-texture-p/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Whovian Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/the-doctor-x32-whovian-texture-p/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Whovian Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/the-doctor-x32-tardis-2-0-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 TARDIS 2.0 Map Whovian Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><strong>Kyctarniq's Photobased:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x16-calorie-reduced/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Photobased Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-photo-based/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Photobased Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><strong>Kyctarniq's Technic:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-tekkit/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Classic 3.1.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/k32-tekkit-classic-313/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Classic 3.1.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-tekkit-lite-0-5-9/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Lite 0.6.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-tekkit-a-new-fron/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit 1.2.9g</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/kyctarniqs-tekkit-legends-texture-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Legends 1.1.1</a></li>\n<li><strong>Kyctarniq's FTB:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-ftb-mindcrack-tex/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Mindcrack 1.4.7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-ftb-ultimate-text/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Ultimate 1.4.7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-ftb-direwolf20-re/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Direwolf20 1.7.10</a></li>\n<li><strong>FancyCraft:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/fancy-craft-x32-classy-resource/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Classy Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/fancy-craft-x64-classy-resource/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x64 Classy Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/79523-fancy-craft-x128-classy-resource\" rel=\"nofollow\">x128 Classy Resource Pack</a></li>\n</ul>",
